<title>THAILAND: Seamico posts 201 mln baht loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>Seamico posts 201 mln baht loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	loss     6.18    vs    profit   0.06</p>
<p>    Net		 loss   201.48    vs    profit   1.68</p>
<p>NOTES: Revenues not stated. Company's full name is Seamico Securities Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
